# Wave T51 (Astral kit): duskroof — worn only by the shipped Astral Shrine stamp's tr roof cells, so the town's landmark wears the town's own register: DUSK TIMBER SHINGLES, deep violet ancient-timber shingle courses with pale lit top edges, dark seams and staggered end joints — the approved painting's dusk-violet roofs against the houses' brown timber. Horizontal violet shingle courses: unlike Fenland's boardroof (vertical olive boards), Heritage's heritageroof (teal slate), Shardfall's shardroof (grey checker slate), Inglenook's domeroof (gold dome segments). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T51-ASTRAL-PLAN.md §5.)
